sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant Dashboard as 📊 Dashboard
    participant Hook as 🎣 React Hook
    participant QueryClient as 🔄 Query Client
    participant AnalyticsService as 🎯 Analytics Service
    participant Cache as 📦 Cache
    participant Transform as 🔄 Data Transform
    participant API as 🌐 Backend API
    participant DB as 💾 Database
    participant WS as 🔌 WebSocket
    participant Monitor as 📈 Performance Monitor

    Note over User,Monitor: Analytics Data Fetch Flow

    User->>Dashboard: Request Analytics Data
    Dashboard->>Hook: useCreatorEarnings('7d')

    Hook->>QueryClient: Query with cache key
    QueryClient->>Cache: Check cache

    alt Cache Hit
        Cache-->>QueryClient: Return cached data
        QueryClient-->>Hook: Cached analytics data
        Hook-->>Dashboard: Display data
        Dashboard-->>User: Show analytics
    else Cache Miss
        QueryClient->>AnalyticsService: fetchCreatorEarnings('7d')

        AnalyticsService->>Monitor: Track request start
        AnalyticsService->>API: GET /analytics/earnings?period=7d

        API->>DB: Query earnings data
        DB-->>API: Raw earnings data

        API-->>AnalyticsService: Earnings response
        AnalyticsService->>Transform: Transform raw data

        Transform->>Transform: Aggregate metrics
        Transform->>Transform: Format for display
        Transform->>Transform: Calculate performance
        Transform-->>AnalyticsService: Transformed data

        AnalyticsService->>Cache: Store in cache
        AnalyticsService->>Monitor: Track request completion
        AnalyticsService-->>QueryClient: Return analytics data

        QueryClient-->>Hook: Fresh analytics data
        Hook-->>Dashboard: Display data
        Dashboard-->>User: Show analytics
    end

    Note over User,Monitor: Real-time Analytics Updates

    WS->>AnalyticsService: payment_received event
    AnalyticsService->>Cache: Invalidate earnings cache
    AnalyticsService->>QueryClient: Invalidate queries
    QueryClient->>Hook: Trigger refetch
    Hook->>AnalyticsService: Fetch updated data

    AnalyticsService->>API: GET /analytics/earnings
    API->>DB: Query latest data
    DB-->>API: Updated data
    API-->>AnalyticsService: Fresh response

    AnalyticsService->>Transform: Transform updated data
    Transform-->>AnalyticsService: Transformed data
    AnalyticsService-->>Hook: Updated analytics
    Hook-->>Dashboard: Refresh display
    Dashboard-->>User: Live update notification

    Note over User,Monitor: Error Handling Flow

    User->>Dashboard: Request analytics (network error)
    Dashboard->>Hook: useCreatorEarnings('30d')
    Hook->>QueryClient: Query
    QueryClient->>AnalyticsService: fetchCreatorEarnings

    AnalyticsService->>Monitor: Track error attempt 1
    AnalyticsService->>API: GET /analytics/earnings
    API-->>AnalyticsService: Network Error

    AnalyticsService->>AnalyticsService: Wait (exponential backoff)
    AnalyticsService->>Monitor: Track retry attempt 2
    AnalyticsService->>API: Retry request
    API-->>AnalyticsService: Success response

    AnalyticsService->>Transform: Transform data
    Transform-->>AnalyticsService: Transformed data
    AnalyticsService->>Monitor: Track successful recovery
    AnalyticsService-->>QueryClient: Return data
    QueryClient-->>Hook: Analytics data
    Hook-->>Dashboard: Display with success message
    Dashboard-->>User: Show analytics + recovery notification

    Note over User,Monitor: Performance Monitoring

    loop Every Request
        Monitor->>Monitor: Record timing
        Monitor->>Monitor: Track cache performance
        Monitor->>Monitor: Monitor error rates
        Monitor->>Monitor: Calculate response times
    end

    Monitor->>Dashboard: Performance metrics
    Dashboard->>User: Show performance insights
